.Dd March 2, 2026
.Dt ELF_USES_MMAP 3
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm elf_uses_mmap
.Nd query whether an opened object is backed by mmap
.Sh LIBRARY
libelfobj
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In elfobj.h
.Ft int
.Fn elf_uses_mmap "const elfobj_t *obj"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Fn elf_uses_mmap
returns whether
.Fa obj
is backed by a memory-mapped input image.
.Sh RETURN VALUES
Returns non-zero when mmap-backed, 0 otherwise.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr elf_open_with_options 3
